# Goal

Make realtime collaboration resilient to temporary WebSocket/STOMP
disconnections.

The core correctness principle is:

    REST/database state is authoritative.

WebSocket events are an optimization for realtime synchronization.

Clients must NOT depend on receiving every WebSocket event.

If a client disconnects, misses events, and later reconnects, it must
converge back to the current authoritative backend state.

