14. CREATE/UPDATE/DELETE Missed-Event Recovery

All three cases are recovered by step 9 above:

Missed CREATE: The new area is in the REST response → appears after clearLayers + addPersistedArea.

Missed UPDATE: The updated area is in the REST response with its new state (name, geometry, version) → replaces stale version after clearLayers.

Missed DELETE: The deleted area has status = DELETED so it is excluded from the REST response (query filters status = ACTIVE) → after clearLayers, the area polygon is not re-added. It disappears correctly.

